1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,801
So when people say northern pakistan is like paradise they they are not lying they are not lying.
他们说，人们把巴基斯坦北部称作天堂，确实没有夸张。

2
00:00:06,801 --> 00:00:11,670
From the minute you actually board the flight I mean we flew from islamabad and from the minute.
从登机那一刻就开始有这种感受。他们是从伊斯兰堡飞过去的。

3
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:17,430
You board the flight and go like 20 minutes outside of islamabad you're like wow this is going to be crazy.
离开伊斯兰堡飞了大约二十分钟，他们就感叹，接下来的风景一定很震撼。

4
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:20,641
When we landed I was so excited.
落地时，她兴奋极了。

5
00:00:20,641 --> 00:00:28,641
I don't think I've ever been to an airport like it where you get off the plane and you're just surrounded by huge mountains.
她觉得自己从没到过这样的机场：一下飞机，四周就是高山。

6
00:00:28,641 --> 00:00:34,641
Although we were a little bit scared on the the way the planes land you like turn around in the mountain valley.
不过，他们在降落途中也有点害怕，飞机要在山谷里转弯。

7
00:00:34,641 --> 00:00:41,831
It's so hairy it's crazy you're like this but also like between two like cliffs in a valley.
他们觉得那个过程很惊险，仿佛就在山谷两侧的悬崖之间飞行。

8
00:00:41,841 --> 00:00:43,921
It's but I just I couldn't stop looking at it.
即使如此，她还是忍不住一直看窗外。

9
00:00:43,921 --> 00:00:50,321
Like we just got off the plane and it looked incredible and I didn't even want to get on the airport bus to go to the terminal.
一下飞机，景色就令人惊叹，她甚至不想坐机场巴士去航站楼。

10
00:00:50,321 --> 00:00:52,721
Cuz I just wanted to look at what was going on.
她只想继续看看周围的景象。

11
00:00:52,721 --> 00:00:55,521
You don't want to get on the bus I just love it so much here.
镜头里有人问她不想上车吗，她说自己实在太喜欢这里了。

12
00:00:55,521 --> 00:00:59,120
It was so nice it's just such a nice bit it's such a nice place as well.
他们说，那一刻很美好，这也是个很棒的地方。

13
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:05,761
Because everybody on that flight or the vast majority of people on that flight are also going there to like go on holiday.
航班上的所有人，或者绝大多数人，也都是来这里度假的。

14
00:01:05,761 --> 00:01:11,440
So from when you get off the plane everybody is there like with their phones taking photos being like wow look where we are.
下飞机后，大家纷纷举着手机拍照，感叹自己到了什么样的地方。

15
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:18,151
And it just it makes you feel so happy and so like it you realize it's a special place when when you land.
她说，这让人非常开心，刚落地就意识到这里是个特别的地方。

16
00:01:18,161 --> 00:01:26,881
Um I mean from the minute we actually landed in scardu as well we had a pretty crazy arrival to our uh to our hotel.
他们刚抵达当地后，前往酒店的过程也很出乎意料；字幕中的地名待核验。

17
00:01:26,881 --> 00:01:32,560
We didn't actually realized but the road to our hotel actually drove through the cold desert.
原来去酒店的路会穿过冷沙漠，他们之前并没有意识到。

18
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:38,000
And this this taxi driver was like this is the cold desert like you can do this this this do you want to stop.
司机告诉他们，这里就是冷沙漠，可以参加一些活动，并问要不要停下来。

19
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:43,591
And we were like you know what yes we've just arrived it's early in the morning but we would love to stop.
他们刚到，时间还很早，但觉得还是很愿意停下来看看。

20
00:01:43,601 --> 00:01:46,951
And that's also going back to like the kindness of people isn't it.
他们说，这又回到了人们很友善这一点。

21
00:01:46,961 --> 00:01:51,430
Yeah he's just like I've got tourists with me they'd probably like to do something here.
他们猜，司机想着自己载的是游客，游客可能会想在这里体验一下。

22
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:56,560
Yeah if you want to stop we can stop and I didn't didn't ask for any extra fee or anything like that.
司机说想停就可以停，也没收取额外费用。

23
00:01:56,560 --> 00:02:02,391
But yeah so because he was so kind we also took him on the jeep with us for our little jeep safari tour.
司机这么友善，他们便也邀请他一起坐吉普车，参加短途沙漠游览。

24
00:02:02,401 --> 00:02:05,351
Which was fun I think he actually had a really good time.
他们觉得司机也玩得挺开心。

25
00:02:05,361 --> 00:02:12,311
Yeah I like the cold desert as well the and the weather in the north is super good it's really nice as well.
他们也喜欢冷沙漠，觉得那次到北部旅行时天气很好。

26
00:02:12,321 --> 00:02:19,761
Yeah we were there around july july time kind of yeah july to end of july and it was perfect.
他们是七月到七月底那段时间去的，觉得天气正合适。

27
00:02:19,761 --> 00:02:22,471
The cold desert not actually that cold.
至于冷沙漠，实际却没有那么冷。

28
00:02:22,481 --> 00:02:32,081
This is called the cold desert it is boiling it's so hot it was hot it's the hot desert I think another thing that people also don't realize.
镜头里他们说，这里叫冷沙漠，却热得像在蒸；还开玩笑说应该叫热沙漠。随后他提起另一个常被忽略的点。

29
00:02:32,081 --> 00:02:40,560
About uh but northern pakistan I'm talking about here but generally in pakistan is how nice some of the hotels are that you can get there.
他说，不只是北部，在巴基斯坦也能找到一些很不错的酒店。

30
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:45,120
This hotel we stayed at it's called the rivage was such an incredible place.
他们住的酒店据他说叫 Rivage，是个令人惊叹的地方；名称待核验。

31
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:52,321
It would not look out of place in austria or switzerland or anywhere in the alps it was just absolutely incredible.
他说，即使放在奥地利、瑞士或阿尔卑斯山区，这家酒店也不会显得格格不入。

32
00:02:52,321 --> 00:02:58,711
If you like outdoors and like outdoorsy activities northern pakistan is the place to go.
如果喜欢户外活动，他觉得巴基斯坦北部是值得去的地方。

33
00:02:58,721 --> 00:03:05,841
The hiking is incredible and the scenery it's just an outdoor person's dream destination.
他称赞那里的徒步与风景，觉得是户外爱好者梦想中的目的地。

34
00:03:05,841 --> 00:03:09,430
We even did uh like a zipline so it's not just hiking.
他们甚至玩了高空滑索，所以不只是徒步。

35
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:15,761
Oh yeah there's fun stuff to do I mean hiking is obviously a big thing but you don't have to be like a massive hiker to go there.
他说，徒步固然是大项目，但并不是非得非常爱徒步的人才能去。

36
00:03:15,761 --> 00:03:20,161
Like me and eve we're we're we're fairly fit and we you know we do a bit of walking.
他和同伴觉得自己体能还可以，平时也会走走路。

37
00:03:20,161 --> 00:03:24,240
But nothing crazy like we're not going to to k 2 or anything like that.
但他们并不做什么特别极限的活动，更不是去攀登 K2 那样的地方。

38
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:28,161
But that zip line was actually really good I think it is the longest zip line in pakistan.
他们觉得那条滑索很棒；他认为它是巴基斯坦最长的，相关最高级待核验。

39
00:03:28,161 --> 00:03:34,000
Like across the atabad lake it's it's literally so long even when you're at the top you can't see the end of it.
滑索横跨一片湖面，长到从起点往下看，甚至看不见终点；湖名字幕待核验。

40
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:38,161
So it's yeah it's it was really fun a really really good experience.
他们说，那次活动很有趣，是一次非常好的体验。
